 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2017-09-27",
   "text": "Protecting Advice for Small Savers Act of 2017 or the PASS Act of 2017\n This bill nullifies the Department of Labor's \"fiduciary duty\" rule (which requires a retirement advisor to act in the best interest of the investor) and otherwise revises standards of conduct for brokers and dealers."
  }
